== B0023 gate table
99-| G1 - Case for Change | Do we agree on the problem/opportunity and value at stake? | Diagnostic, baseline, root causes, value pools. |
100-| G2 - Direction | Are outcomes specific enough to steer decisions? | North Star, outcome tree, KPI definitions, guardrails. |
101-| G3 - Target State | Do we know what must be different operationally? | Target Operating Model, capability gaps, future journeys. |
102-| G4 - Mobilization | Is the portfolio executable and value-backed? | Initiative cards, business cases, roadmap, owners, capacity. |
103-| G5 - Scale | Are pilots/results sufficient to scale? | Performance evidence, adoption, risk closure, decision log. |
104-| G6 - Sustain | Is value embedded in BAU? | Benefits evidence, ownership transfer, controls, continuous improvement backlog. |
